# NEXT_CHAT.md must never be created again, in any form (owner ruling 30). This is the
# best-effort half: git ignore is case-sensitive, has no optional or repeated character
# and cannot say 'files only'. Each pattern is the stem (next, chat, joined by nothing or
# by one of - _ . space) plus one note-like or backup extension and a trailing *, which
# also covers .md.bak, .md.txt and a trailing ~. NOT expressible: two separators in a row,
# fullwidth or zero-width spellings, and the bare name with no extension (it would also
# ignore a DIRECTORY of that name, and everything in it). tests/test_no_next_chat.py is
# the strong guard.
[nN][eE][xX][tT][cC][hH][aA][tT].[mM][dD]*
[nN][eE][xX][tT][cC][hH][aA][tT].[mM][aA][rR][kK][dD][oO][wW][nN]*
[nN][eE][xX][tT][cC][hH][aA][tT].[tT][xX][tT]*
[nN][eE][xX][tT][cC][hH][aA][tT].[tT][eE][xX][tT]*
[nN][eE][xX][tT][cC][hH][aA][tT].[rR][sS][tT]*
[nN][eE][xX][tT][cC][hH][aA][tT].[bB][aA][kK]*
[nN][eE][xX][tT][cC][hH][aA][tT].[oO][lL][dD]*
[nN][eE][xX][tT][cC][hH][aA][tT].[oO][rR][iI][gG]*
[nN][eE][xX][tT][cC][hH][aA][tT].[tT][mM][pP]*
[nN][eE][xX][tT][cC][hH][aA][tT].[cC][oO][pP][yY]*
[nN][eE][xX][tT][-_. ][cC][hH][aA][tT].[mM][dD]*
[nN][eE][xX][tT][-_. ][cC][hH][aA][tT].[mM][aA][rR][kK][dD][oO][wW][nN]*
[nN][eE][xX][tT][-_. ][cC][hH][aA][tT].[tT][xX][tT]*
[nN][eE][xX][tT][-_. ][cC][hH][aA][tT].[tT][eE][xX][tT]*
[nN][eE][xX][tT][-_. ][cC][hH][aA][tT].[rR][sS][tT]*
[nN][eE][xX][tT][-_. ][cC][hH][aA][tT].[bB][aA][kK]*
[nN][eE][xX][tT][-_. ][cC][hH][aA][tT].[oO][lL][dD]*
